 "notes": "Backed by the OIDF conformance suite result: plan oid4vci-1_0-wallet-test-plan, suite 5.3.4, the deferred variant (vci_credential_issuance_mode=deferred), module oid4vci-1_0-wallet-test-credential-issuance PASSED on 2026-11-04 (plan detail: https://localhost.emobix.co.uk:8443/plan-detail.html?log=0rEc6ma7wqb0Q). The poll waits the response's interval on the Clock port between attempts; the scripted clock does not actually sleep."
